1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Agus — Your financial workspace.
Fixture demonstration · No live AI · No real money moved.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Ask. Review. Stay in control.
Bring questions, payment preparation and saved outcomes into one workspace.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:38,000
“How much did I spend on food?”
A focused question. A calculated answer with its source made clear.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:50,000
See the bigger picture.
Ask for income and expenses. The figures come from the saved sample ledger.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
“Explain that.”
Understand where an answer comes from before acting on it.

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Confidence starts with honesty.
Agus says when it cannot see your bank balance. An answer needs a source.

7
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Start with what you know.
“Prepare 500 to Ada at Wema.” Missing account details stay empty for review.

8
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:39,000
One draft. Two recipients.
Choose labelled fictional recipients. Add a second payment and check every field.

9
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Saved is not submitted.
The draft is now a payment job. Verification and your authorization still come next.

10
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Review the details that matter.
Names. Accounts. Amounts. Fee reserves. Fixture names are labelled explicitly.

11
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Your review. Your approval.
Acknowledge the details and approve with the operator password. Submission remains separate.

12
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Every recipient. An explicit outcome.
Submit the simulation, then check status. One succeeds; the other remains processing.

13
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:44,000
“What is still pending?”
Unresolved stays unresolved. Check the existing payment before taking further action.

14
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Come back. Keep context.
Reload the workspace. The conversation and payment status are still there.

15
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:07,000
A record you can return to.
Activity brings saved transfers, references and individual outcomes together.

16
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Questions to understanding. Details to action.
A connected workflow around the financial decisions you need to make.

17
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Agus. Understand the source. Review the details. Stay in control.
Fixture demonstration · No live AI · No real money moved.
